        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-HOGAN-DIYAT-VIA6522-THEOREMS-56-60.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-HOGAN-DIYAT-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH56-DEBIT-ATOMICITY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH57-CAPSTAN-INERTIA-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH58-VIA6522-REG-IO-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH59-INSUFFICIENT-REV-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH60-RULE18-CLOSURE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-DIYAT-PROOF-WITNESS      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-HOGAN-DIYAT.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-HOGAN-DIYAT.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH56-DEBIT-ATOMICITY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH57-CAPSTAN-INERTIA-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH58-VIA6522-REG-IO-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH59-INSUFFICIENT-REV-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH60-RULE18-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-DIYAT-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-DIYAT-PROOF-WITNESS.
